  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "1 pound mochiko (glutinous rice flour)",
    "2.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "2 cups water",
    "1 (14 ounce) can coconut milk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.25 teaspoon red food color",
    "0.25 cup potato starch, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch pan with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S2V8lqvKZIVQYt8z2RXSKoMtOEU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/31400-chi-chi-dango-mochi-step-1-BG-8326-2-83eb7a5f9bfd461eb5fbc8b9cd515708.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/31400/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk mochiko, sugar, and baking powder together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/shGNMKhlCNP39tUgqSpdjaOoX2c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/31400-chi-chi-dango-mochi-step-3-BG-8328-2-4696f8ce0ec84905b77945abe9e839da.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/31400/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine water, coconut milk, vanilla, and food coloring in a medium bowl. Blend in dry ingredients, then pour into the prepared pan. Cover with foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zBagXOn-9hZCpIEoB7pI4246JsU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/31400-chi-chi-dango-mochi-step-6-BG-8335-2-4461aa8f9f234de88adad6ebef9a18ee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/31400/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 1 hour. Remove from the oven and let cool completely, 30 minutes to 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FpHmCEycP-LSp9JBJxKRtKj1wqg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/31400-chi-chi-dango-mochi-step-7-BG-8401-2-00627bf0e5834987b88f9b12b7d09aa4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/31400/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dust a work surface with potato starch. Invert the pan onto the work surface. Use a plastic knife to cut into 36 squares.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
